      "writtenOn": "2022-11-11T20:36:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s fair to say that we\u0027d want to confirm the format can support the desired sample count. \n\nTo best support this, I actually made isRenderable \u0026 isTexturable methods of the FormatInfo struct. This negates the need for some repeated code to access member attributes of FormatInfo. isRenderable also now takes in a requested sample count and checks if it is present within the format info\u0027s supported sample counts.",
