        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-09T14:58:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These don\u0027t matter for DepthStencil. We need another query for is_supported_depth_stencil(); In general this would be storing some form of \"FormatInfo\" for DS formats. However, I think we can keep it much simpler. We can just keep a list of supported formats for the device instead of all the flags and such. When we call the GetPhysicalDeviceFormatProperties function we can just look at the optimal flags (since that\u0027s all we ever use) and look if the contain the depth stencil flag. If so add the format to the supported list or something.\n\nThen again we may also want to know what sampleCounts are supported with the format as well...",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 163,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 164,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "a15d58e25db5c52cac51f8904f967d4244c7558b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "25bd60f6_1b79a1a5",
        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/vk/VulkanCaps.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 164,
      "author": {
        "id": 18914
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-11T20:36:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, you\u0027re absolutely right. Okay, I did a first pass at adding a `DepthStencilFormatInfo` struct. \n\nBoth `FormatInfo` and the new `DepthStencilFormatInfo` now both contain a newly-added `SupportedSampleCounts` struct. I added `SupportedSampleCounts` to reuse sample count code between the 2 format info structs.\n\nDepth stencil format operations have been added that mirror how the existing format table works. We now verify depth/stencil attachment support and that the requested sample count is supported in `getDefaultDepthStencilTextureInfo`.",
      "parentUuid": "3d8056e6_ad2eb6af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 163,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 164,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "a15d58e25db5c52cac51f8904f967d4244c7558b",
