      "writtenOn": "2022-11-09T14:58:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m thinking we may want to also support the TRANSIENT bit like we do for MSAA. This will involve passing in a discardable flag to this query. Though we should confirm that we are discarding stencils as well all the time (this was a little murky in Ganesh but I believe that\u0027s the policy for Graphite). However, if easier we can do this on a follow up CL.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 174,
        "startChar": 28,
